03},{"id":"data-estimation","parentId":"statistics","name":"总体估计","sortOrder":3204},{"id":"data-regression","parentId":"statistics","name":"线性回归","sortOrder":3205},{"id":"data-independence","parentId":"statistics","name":"独立性检验","sortOrder":3206},{"id":"data-correlation","parentId":"statistics","name":"相关关系与成对数据","sortOrder":3207},{"id":"counting-principles","parentId":"counting","name":"分类与分步计数","sortOrder":3300},{"id":"permutations","parentId":"counting","name":"排列","sortOrder":3301},{"id":"combinations","parentId":"counting","name":"组合","sortOrder":3302},{"id":"counting-restrictions","parentId":"counting","name":"有限制条件的排列组合","sortOrder":3303},{"id":"binomial-theorem","parentId":"counting","name":"二项式定理","sortOrder":3304},{"id":"binomial-coefficients","parentId":"counting","name":"二项式系数与特定项","sortOrder":3305},{"id":"complex-operations","parentId":"complex","name":"复数四则运算","sortOrder":3400},{"id":"complex-plane","parentId":"complex","name":"复平面与几何意义","sortOrder":3401},{"id":"complex-modulus","parentId":"complex","name":"复数模与共轭","sortOrder":3402},{"id":"complex-equations","parentId":"complex","name":"复数与方程","sortOrder":3403}],"sources":[{"id":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","title":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","category":"上海高考","region":"上海","school":"","schoolTier":"","examType":"其他","examYear":2000,"term":"","paper":"","createdAt":"2026-09-25 07:25:06"}],"questions":[{"id":"23696c55-b93e-4f06-951e-0bc171728955","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"9","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"若两个长方体的长, 宽, 高分别为 $5\\mathrm{cm}$, $4\\mathrm{cm}$, $3\\mathrm{cm}$, 把它们两个全等的面重合在一起组成大长方体, 则大长方体的对角线最长为 $\\underline{\\qquad}\\mathrm{cm}$.","answerLatex":"$5\\sqrt{5}$","officialAnswer":"$5\\sqrt{5}$","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"原件第5页“答案要点”第一大题第9题","aiSolution":"两个长方体以全等的面重合后, 大长方体只有一个边长加倍. 按加倍的边长分类, 新长方体的长, 宽, 高分别可以是 $(10, 4, 3)$, $(5, 8, 3)$ 或 $(5, 4, 6)$, 单位均为 $\\mathrm{cm}$.\n\n由长方体体对角线公式 $d=\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}$, 三种情况下对角线长度的平方分别为 $10^2+4^2+3^2=125$, $5^2+8^2+3^2=98$, $5^2+4^2+6^2=77$. 因为 $125$ 最大, 所以最长对角线为 $\\sqrt{125}=5\\sqrt{5}\\,\\mathrm{cm}$.","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 11:54:55","topicIds":["solid-surface-volume"],"assetUrl":null},{"id":"4bed95b4-17ab-4daa-892f-b17520fa3ea1","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"5","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"在三角形 $ABC$ 中, $\\sqrt{2}\\sin A=\\sqrt{3\\cos A}$, 则 $\\angle A=\\underline{\\qquad}$.","answerLatex":"60^\\circ","officialAnswer":"60°","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"原件第5页“答案要点”第5题","aiSolution":"由 $\\sqrt{2}\\sin A=\\sqrt{3\\cos A}$, 两边平方得 $2\\sin^2 A=3\\cos A$. 令 $c=\\cos A$, 则 $2(1-c^2)=3c$, 即 $(2c-1)(c+2)=0$. 因为 $-1\\leq c\\leq1$, 所以 $c=\\frac12$.\n\n又 $0^\\circ<A<180^\\circ$, 故 $A=60^\\circ$.","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 11:52:42","topicIds":["trig-basic-relations"],"assetUrl":null},{"id":"5725cb6a-420c-4eac-a3ed-d23781110592","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"3","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"方程 $\\log_4(3x-1)=\\log_4(x-1)+\\log_4(3+x)$ 的解是 $\\underline{\\qquad}$.","answerLatex":"x=2","officialAnswer":"x=2","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"原件第5页“答案要点”第一大题第3题","aiSolution":"由对数真数条件得 $x>1$.\n\n由对数运算法则, $3x-1=(x-1)(x+3)$, 即 $x^2-x-2=0$, 解得 $x=2$ 或 $x=-1$.\n\n检验定义域, 只有 $x=2$ 符合条件.","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 11:50:16","topicIds":["logarithm-operations","logarithmic-function"],"assetUrl":null}],"options":{"questionTypes":["选择题","多选题","填空题","解答题","其他"],"sourceCategories":["上海高考","全国高考","学校试卷","教辅习题","其他"],"examTypes":["春考","秋考","模拟考试","月考","期中","期末","联考","其他"],"schoolTiers":["四校","八大","其他"],"provinces":["北京","天津","河北","山西","内蒙古","辽宁","吉林","黑龙江","上海","江苏","浙江","安徽","福建","江西","山东","河南","湖北","湖南","广东","广西","海南","重庆","四川","贵州","云南","西藏","陕西","甘肃","青海","宁夏","新疆","香港","澳门","台湾"]}}